">10.1242/jcs.02438</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Jansen S, Stefan C, Creemers JW et al. Proteolytic maturation and activation of autotaxin (NPP2), a secreted metastasis-enhancing lysophospholipase D. J Cell Sci 2005; 118: 3081&#x02013;9. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15985467</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Meeteren</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name><name><surname>Ruurs</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Christodoulou</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Inhibition of autotaxin by lysophosphatidic acid and sphingosine 1-phosphate</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>2005</year><volume>280</volume><fpage>21155</fpage><lpage>21161</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1074/jbc.M413183200</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">van Meeteren LA, Ruurs P, Christodoulou E et al. Inhibition of autotaxin by lysophosphatidic acid and sphingosine 1-phosphate. J Biol Chem 2005; 280: 21155&#x02013;61. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15769751</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cimpean</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Stefan</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Gijsbers</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Substrate-specifying determinants of the nucleotide pyrophosphatases/phosphodiesterases NPP1 and NPP2</article-title><source>Biochem J</source><year>2004</year><volume>381</volume><fpage>71</fpage><lpage>77</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1042/BJ20040465</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Cimpean A, Stefan C, Gijsbers R et al. Substrate-specifying determinants of the nucleotide pyrophosp